# Cursor 代码索引忽略（语法与 .gitignore 相同）
# 与根目录 .gitignore 对齐；以下为补充规则，减少生成物/文档噪音，保留业务源码与 .proto

### OpenIM（与 .gitignore 一致）###
logs/
.devcontainer/
components/
out-test/
Dockerfile.cross

### macOS / 本地工具 ###
.DS_Store
.playwright-mcp/

### 构建产物 ###
tmp/
bin/
output/
_output/
build/
dist/
deployments/charts/generated-configs/

### 配置与密钥（勿入索引）###
.env
config/config.yaml
config/notification.yaml
start-config.yml

### 部署生成物 / Helm 模板（重复 YAML，低索引价值）###
deployments/openim-server/charts/
deployments/charts/
deployments/deploy/
deployments/templates/

### 本地笔记 ###
.idea.md
.todo.md
.note.md

### 生成代码（以 .proto 为准，勿重复索引）###
protocol/**/*.pb.go
protocol/**/*_grpc.pb.go

### 功能 / E2EE / OpenMLS / Virgil 设计文档（长文，以实现与 .proto 为准）###
*-design.md
e2ee-*.md
google-authenticator*.md
virgil*.md
virgil*-e2ee-*.yaml
docs/virgil-e2ee-*.md

### 其它设计/API 参考文档 ###
docs/redpacket-api.md
docs/mongo-collections.md
cmd/openim-rpc/**/*-design.md
cmd/openim-rpc/**/backend-api.md
cmd/openim-rpc/**/client-integration-guide.md
cmd/openim-rpc/**/*-integration*.md

### 文档与资源（保留 docs/contrib、根 README；忽略多语言 readme 与静态资源）###
docs/readme/
docs/.generated_docs
docs/contributing/
assets/

### 测试与脚本输出 ###
test/e2e/output/
scripts/**/*.log

### 通用备份与临时文件 ###
*.bak
*.gho
*.ori
*.orig
*.tmp
*~
*.BACKUP.*
*.BASE.*
*.LOCAL.*
*.REMOTE.*

### VS Code（除团队共享配置外）###
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace

### Go ###
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
vendor/
go.work.sum

### 二进制 / 本地 DB（勿入索引，体积大且无语义价值）###
*.wasm
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
openim-sdk-core/wasm/cmd/cmd
openim-sdk-core/identifier.sqlite
openim-sdk-core/pkg/db/*.db

### JetBrains / IDE ###
.idea/
out/

### Git / CI（低价值索引）###
.git/
.github/

### Tags / 索引工具 ###
TAGS
tags
gtags.files
GTAGS
GRTAGS
GPATH
GSYMS
cscope.files
cscope.out
cscope.in.out
cscope.po.out
